&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Broken equation $61&lt;em&gt;{10}$, $111101_2$, $3D&lt;/em&gt;{16}$&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fixed equation $61_{10}$, $111101_2$, $3D_{16}$&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;language-md highlighter-rouge&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Broken equation $61_{10}$, $111101_2$, $3D_{16}$

Fixed equation $61&lt;span class=&quot;se&quot;&gt;\_&lt;/span&gt;{10}$, $111101&lt;span class=&quot;se&quot;&gt;\_&lt;/span&gt;2$, $3D&lt;span class=&quot;se&quot;&gt;\_&lt;/span&gt;{16}$
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Note: The fixed equation only works when the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.mathjax.org/en/latest/input/tex/delimiters.html&quot;&gt;single dollar sign is enabled&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
